flowchart LR
  T[Text tokens] --> E[Nemotron/Qwen embeddings]
  I[IDE / terminal screenshot] --> V[InternViT 300M dynamic 448px tiles]
  V --> P[Adaptive projector + token budget]
  P --> E
  E --> L0[Layers 0-1 sliding causal attention]
  L0 --> LC[Layers 2+ CSA/HCA alternating]
  LC --> C[Shared K=V, compression, partial RoPE, sinks]
  C --> X[Lightning Indexer top-k]
  X --> O[Grouped low-rank output + mHC]
  O --> H[LM head]

